```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>BlueWave Systems</title>

    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a, #1e3a8a);
            color: #ffffff;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .container {
            width: 90%;
            max-width: 800px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .card {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 50px 40px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 48px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 38px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .subtitle {
            color: #cbd5e1;
            font-size: 18px;
            margin-bottom: 35px;
        }

        .info {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 20px;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }

        .info-box {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        }

        .label {
            color: #94a3b8;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .value {
            font-size: 20px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .status {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 30px;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            background: #16a34a;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        footer {
            margin-top: 25px;
            color: #94a3b8;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            h1 {
                font-size: 30px;
            }

            .card {
                padding: 35px 20px;
            }

            .info {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <div class="container">

        <div class="card">

            <div class="logo">🌊</div>

            <h1>Welcome to BlueWave Systems</h1>

            <p class="subtitle">
                Infrastructure powered by Automation &amp; DevOps
            </p>

            <div class="info">

                <div class="info-box">
                    <div class="label">SERVER</div>
                    <div class="value">{{ inventory_hostname }}</div>
                </div>

                <div class="info-box">
                    <div class="label">WEB SERVER</div>
                    <div class="value">{{ package_name }}</div>
                </div>

                <div class="info-box">
                    <div class="label">DEPLOYMENT</div>
                    <div class="value">Ansible</div>
                </div>

                <div class="info-box">
                    <div class="label">STATUS</div>
                    <div class="value">Operational</div>
                </div>

            </div>

            <div class="status">
                ● Server Online
            </div>

        </div>

        <footer>
            BlueWave Systems &copy; 2026 — Automated Infrastructure
        </footer>

    </div>

</body>
</html>
```

